    "summary": "During [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if it is not **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**, this unit can take a **[psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)** of a D6. If it does:\n\n- it becomes **battle-shocked** on a 1\n- pick a **[visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility)** enemy unit, and ranged attacks against it get **[[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover)**",
